{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"ja","entryId":"codex-hostile-species","chapterId":"handbook-monster-2033022","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-hostile-species-handbook-monster-2033022-handbook-monster-2033022-0","text":"「紅月」は宿主の弱さをつけ狙う。心に潜む魔を唆し、威霊を奪い、その容貌までも変えていく。\n終わることのないその狩りにおいて、飛霄は狩る側か、狩られる側か。","speaker":""}]}
